{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28036","headline":"宣武军镇作 · 王彦威","name":"宣武军镇作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天兵十万勇如貔，正是酬恩报国时。\n汴水波澜喧鼓角，隋堤杨柳拂旌旗。\n前驱红斾关西将，坐间青娥赵国姬。\n寄语长安旧冠盖，麤官到底是男儿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王彦威","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28036.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28036","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}